		(uuid "e442acb0-50d2-452b-992b-4054d64b22e9")
	)
	(text "Notes:\n- USB or 12V power (not Both at same time)\n- 5V-25V input voltage allowed (5V may not work well)\n- output 5V will not back-power the board.\n- 1 LED for CAN status (GreenFlash=receiving, RedFlash=bad)\n- 1 LED for each port (Green=switch connected to GND, Blue=output high, ADC threshold, ADC brightness)\n- IO0&IO2 support DAC+OPAMP\n- IO0 supports Neopixel (any length string with 6 identical color segments)\n- IOs input 5V: {pullups, input switch, AB encoder, PWM decoder, ADC 10-bit}\n- IOs output 5V: {PWM output, digital out, neopixel}\n- CAN message rate selectable: 10hz, 50hz, immediate<50Hz (probably important for ADC input)\n- CAN ID settable by software without touching device (random number supplied, and it's ID can be changed)\n- configuration settings per pin: pullup(off), ADC, DAC, digital in(default), digital out, PWM out, PWM decoder, AB decoder, neopixel\n- runtime write data per pin: digital_out&OE[0=low, 1=high, 2+=tri-state], DAC[8], PWM duty[8], neopixel[segment 6][rgb 24],\n- runtime response data per pin (8-bytes total): {digital[1] / ADC[10] / AB_encoder[32] / PWM_decoder[16+16]}"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 101.854 253.746 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "e56cc947-9589-4a1b-81e9-3c6abb78538e")
	)
